Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS}\N{\c&Hff8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:04.45,Titulo do ep,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Mosasaurus Picture-Story Show{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.72,0:01:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF SERIOUS PALEOTOLOGY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A picture-story show in this day and age?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}'{\i0}'And so, as Hebitaro became friends with everyone,what fell from his eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.55,0:01:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but scales''.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.61,0:01:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1} {\i0}''Snakes don't have eyelids;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.51,0:01:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,their eyes are covered with transparent scales''.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,''And that's where the saying \N'scales falling from one's eyes' comes from''.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's some chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:01:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Give me some!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dino-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that guy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying his best in his own way as an extracurricular activity for the Paleontology Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't snakes modern creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't entirely say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is this picture-story show!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:28.58,The Story of Mosasaurus,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\c&HFF2553&}The Story of Mosasaurus{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Story of Mosasaurus"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,P-President Tetori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosasaurus is not a dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.73,0:02:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a reptile that lived in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting so frustrated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Covered in fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,snake-like scale skin, it was indeed a reptile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mosasaurus,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,even ate sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you scared too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Its ability to eat sharks was thanks to the secret in its teeth and jaws!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosasaurus had sharp teeth, up to 100 of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And on its upper jaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,there were actually two rows of teeth lined up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're actually getting into it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosasaurus used its double-jointed jaws \Nthat opened wide to bite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and swallow prey whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He is totally drawn in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Relatives of Mosasaurus were also abundant in Cretaceous Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a Mosasaurus is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,sleeping right near us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,beneath our feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosasaurus are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He is completely captivated now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact Mosasaurus is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,actually a relative of snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Features like these jaws and teeth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,are the biggest proof that Mosasaurus evolved from the same ancestor as snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino, come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,P-President?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful that relatives of Mosasaurus are still around us today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's Dino-kun's picture-story show!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Snakes are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino-kun is amazing too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't compete with President Tetori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:04:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Scales fell from my eyes!
